{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55130","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 二十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 二十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凶神将，又克主行年。\n若遇行年克前四，此是交战（京本作「胜」）胜当先，喜跃信（京本作「作」）超（辛本、川本作「趋」）前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}